      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>The Green Beauty Community Foundation is dedicated to connecting individuals and brands who share a passion for sustainable beauty. We strive to inspire, educate, and empower our members to make informed choices that celebrate beauty while respecting our planet.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Advanced sustainable beauty education by developing comprehensive website resources tailored for salon professionals, providing actionable guides, downloadable resources, and checklists on waste management, ethical sourcing, and clean beauty practices. This initiative engaged a broad audience of beauty professionals, enhancing accessibility to sustainability knowledge and empowering them to make environmentally conscious decisions that benefit their businesses and the planet.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
        <ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>51173</ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Strengthened sustainability advocacy through live webinars and the "Business of Sustainability Podcast," delivering real-world insights and case studies from industry pioneers. This created opportunities for direct engagement between brands and professionals, showcasing innovative sustainable practices and facilitating meaningful industry collaboration toward environmental responsibility in the beauty sector.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Published a comprehensive industry-focused guidebook serving as a cornerstone resource for salons and spas pursuing sustainability goals. This practical publication offered actionable solutions for reducing waste, conserving water, and enhancing energy efficiency in beauty establishments, while providing guidance on eco-friendly practices and sustainable product selection that yield both environmental and economic benefits.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
